# Design source (W04). NOT ignored for tidiness: this repo is PUBLIC, and these
# files carry mock figures - Markets priced 1,284 and Ladder rungs 9,418
# against a real board of 11 and 83, plus blank study rows and invented
# intervals. On a site whose whole positioning is that every published figure is
# sourced, those are the worst possible files to publish unlabelled. They may
# ship later as a deliberate docs/design/ commit with a README stating that the
# numbers are mock; they must never arrive swept in under an unrelated commit.
